    "Commit bdd93ef627 notes that sharing SOURCES_PATH across checkouts 'happens reliably with contrib/guix/guix-build... so when SOURCES_PATH is shared between checkouts, a checkout can find another checkout's tarball, see no newer files, and build from the wrong sources.'",
    "Upstream PRs #35765 and #36927 were already merged into master and 32.x."
  ],
